{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f This is an in-development build. Some features are unfinished, and content is subject to change.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter the World of &quot;The Endless Palace&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A gothic nightmare where every step is a trial, and the palace around you lives its own mysterious life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herman, a hunter trapped in the &quot;Endless Palace&quot;, is forced to fight for survival in a world where architecture defies the laws of physics and shadows whisper strange thoughts. His goal is his long-lost beloved Berenice, whose voice echoes through the labyrinth of halls, bridges and arches. But the palace won't let him go so easily...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Atmospheric exploration in gothic environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Third-person combat using melee and ranged weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Optional English and Russian language support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will the hunter save Berenice? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Or will he become another ghost in the walls of this eternal nightmare?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Boundless Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Five years ago","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, my love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"World, Absurd, Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"All t